cleartrainerflag 0xB1
cleartrainerflag 0xB2
cleartrainerflag 0xB3
cleartrainerflag 0xB4
cleartrainerflag 0xD5
cleartrainerflag 0xD6
cleartrainerflag 0xD7
return

//---------------
#org 0x1A6BE0
cleartrainerflag 0x128
cleartrainerflag 0x129
cleartrainerflag 0x142
cleartrainerflag 0x143
cleartrainerflag 0x144
cleartrainerflag 0x188
cleartrainerflag 0x190
cleartrainerflag 0x191
return


//---------
// Strings
//---------
#org 0x7402C5
= You don't mess around!

#org @MSGGreeting
= Hello, you're the trainer from\nearlier!\pSay, what's your approach when\ncatching and training POKÈMON?\pMy policy is all about embracing\nchange and going with the flow of\lbattle, let me show you!

#org @MSGDefeated
= Wow!\nYou're too much!\pAll right!\pYou can have the CASCADEBADGE to\nshow you beat me.\p\c\h06¡[player] received the CASCADEBADGE\nfrom MISTY!\c\h17\c\h0B«¿\c\h08\n\c\h08[Ke]\c\h18\p\c\h06«The CASCADEBADGE makes all POKÈMON\nobey, including outsiders you got\lin trades.\pIt also allows the use of the\nLAPRAS PAIGER which calls forth a\lLAPRAS to traverse bodies of water.

#org @MSGAfterBattle
= [player] received LAPRAS PAIGER\nfrom MISTY.

#org @MSGAfterBattle2
= Oh? You're a researcher!\pSorry, I got carried away but I\ncan help you with your research.\pSee, while it's well-known that\nPOKÈMON can evolve when coming\linto contact with particular\lstones, holding onto certain\lnatural items they have affinity\lwith can trigger an evolution\lduring a trade.\pOne such POKÈMON was one of my\nPOLIWHIRL who evolved further,\lcausing a torrential change from\lwhat should've been a wrathful\lPOLIWRATH to peaceful POLITOED.\pI can trade you a POLIWHIRL so you\ncan see for yourself!

#org @MSGAfterBattle3
= How about a trade for a POKÈMON\nthat changes from harmless to\ltotally dangerous?\pBring me a GYARADOS and you can\nhave POLIWHIRL.

#org @MSGTrade
= So!\nDid you bring me a GYARADOS?\pWant to trade it for my\n[buffer2]?

#org @MSGTradeComplete
= Flow in motion!\pHere comes[.]\p[.]POLITOED, the FROG POKÈMON!